            "detailed_description": "Europe, 1938: The lost Ark was just a warm-up! Now Adolf Hitler is after the most powerful talisman of all - the Holy Grail. A few brave men stand in his way. Fortunately, one of them is Indiana Jones, and this time he has his dad with him.<br>\t\t\tThe bad guys are in your face all the way – mercenaries, traitors and spies. Not to mention everything the Luftwaffe can throw at you.... Can you handle the heat?<br>\t\t\tIf you can, you just might earn a higher I.Q. (Indy Quotient) than the man with the whip and the hat.<br>\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visit dozens of locations you never saw in the movie!<br>\t\t\t</li><li>No typing to slow you down…. Just point 'n'click!<br>\t\t\t</li><li>Outstanding high resolution 3d graphics.<br>\t\t\t</li><li>Over 100 sound effects…. Plus movie theme music.<br>\t\t\t</li></ul>",
